          "content": {
            "id": "c6362bfa-aae1-31df-baca-d0e60919c50e",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Amazon's Black Friday sales, Goldman Sachs acquires ETF issuer",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance Senior Producer <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/john-hyland/\">John Hyland</a> tracks Monday's top-moving stocks and biggest market stories in this<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\"> Market Minute</a>.</p>\n<p>Copper (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/HG=F\">HG=F</a>) hit a record high, while silver (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SI=F\">SI=F</a>) continues its record-breaking rally.</p>\n<p>Goldman Sachs (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GS\">GS</a>) is acquiring Innovator Capital, an issuer of exchange-traded funds (ETFs), for $2 billion.</p>\n<p>Amazon's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMZN\">AMZN</a>) artificial intelligence (AI) chatbot, Rufus, helped drive Black Friday sales, according to data from Sensor Tower.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
            "summary": "Yahoo Finance Senior Producer John Hyland tracks Monday's top-moving stocks and biggest market stories in this Market Minute. Copper (HG=F) hit a record high, while silver (SI=F) continues its record-breaking rally. Goldman Sachs (GS) is acquiring Innovator Capital, an issuer of exchange-traded funds (ETFs), for $2 billion. Amazon's (AMZN) artificial intelligence (AI) chatbot, Rufus, helped drive Black Friday sales, according to data from Sensor Tower. Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.",
